<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Pythonic FP @PROJECTNAME@ documentation</title>
<style>
/* Palette lifted from Furo's own CSS so this page matches the Sphinx builds. */
:root {
  --font-stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial,
                sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji";
  --font-stack--monospace: "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, Monaco,
                           "Liberation Mono", "Lucida Console", monospace;

  --color-foreground-primary: #000;
  --color-foreground-secondary: #5a5c63;
  --color-foreground-muted: #6b6f76;
  --color-background-primary: #fff;
  --color-background-secondary: #f8f9fb;
  --color-background-hover: #efeff4;
  --color-background-border: #eeebee;
  --color-brand-primary: #0a4bff;
  --color-brand-content: #2757dd;
  --color-brand-visited: #872ee0;
  --color-card-background: transparent;
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-foreground-primary: #cfd0d0;
    --color-foreground-secondary: #9ca0a5;
    --color-foreground-muted: #81868d;
    --color-background-primary: #131416;
    --color-background-secondary: #1a1c1e;
    --color-background-hover: #1e2124;
    --color-background-border: #303335;
    --color-brand-primary: #3d94ff;
    --color-brand-content: #5ca5ff;
    --color-brand-visited: #b27aeb;
    --color-card-background: #18181a;
  }
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  background: var(--color-background-primary);
  color: var(--color-foreground-primary);
  font-family: var(--font-stack);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin: 0;
}

main {
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 46em;
  padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 2.5em;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
}

.lede {
  color: var(--color-foreground-secondary);
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
}

a {
  color: var(--color-brand-content);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-color: var(--color-background-border);
}
a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--color-foreground-muted); }
a:visited { color: var(--color-brand-visited); }

.builds {
  display: grid;
  gap: 1rem;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.build {
  background: var(--color-card-background);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-background-border);
  border-radius: 0.4rem;
  color: inherit;
  display: block;
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s ease-out, border-color 0.15s ease-out;
}
.build:hover, .build:focus-visible {
  background: var(--color-background-hover);
  border-color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
}
.build:visited { color: inherit; }

.build .name {
  color: var(--color-brand-primary);
  display: block;
  font-size: 1.25em;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.build .version {
  color: var(--color-foreground-primary);
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-stack--monospace);
  font-size: 0.8125em;
  margin-top: 0.3rem;
}

.build .note {
  color: var(--color-foreground-secondary);
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.875em;
  margin-top: 0.6rem;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 0.8125em;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
}

ul.links {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 1.2rem;
}
ul.links li { margin: 0.3rem 0; }

footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-background-border);
  color: var(--color-foreground-secondary);
  font-size: 0.875em;
  margin-top: 2.5rem;
  padding-top: 1rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Pythonic FP @PROJECTNAME@</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A collection of miscellaneous self-contained functions and classes with
    minimal dependencies.
  </p>

  <div class="builds">
    <a class="build" href="release/">
      <span class="name">Release documentation</span>
      <span class="version">pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@ @RELEASE@</span>
      <span class="note">Documents the version currently published on PyPI.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="build" href="development/">
      <span class="name">Development documentation</span>
      <span class="version">pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@ @DEVEL@</span>
      <span class="note">Built from the tip of the <code>main</code> branch. Unreleased.</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
  <ul class="links">
    <li>PyPI project
      <a href="https://pypi.org/project/pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@/">pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@</a>.</li>
    <li>GitHub source code repo
      <a href="https://github.com/grscheller/pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@">grscheller/pythonic-fp-@PYPINAME@</a>.</li>
    <li>Part of the
      <a href="https://grscheller.github.io/pythonic-fp/projects/@PYPINAME@.html">Pythonic FP</a>
      family of projects.</li>
  </ul>

  <footer>Copyright &copy; 2023-2026, Geoffrey R. Scheller</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
